<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch sets HKR Int'l warrants.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets HKR Int'l warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said on Monday it has launched 300 million American-style call warrants on shares of HKR International Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$12.25	 PREMIUM	    21.02 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.2575	GEARING	    4.76x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  16.DEC.97	SETTLEMENT DATE  13.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	LISTING DATE     15.JAN.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$12.25	 EXER LOT	   8,000</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		  PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
